{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52322","headline":"诗（幷序） 八十三 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 八十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"思量小家妇，贫奇恶行迹。\n酒肉独自抽（项疑「袖」），糟糠遣他吃。\n生活九牛挽，[唱]（嗢）叫（苏一四八七卷作「说唱」）百夫敌。\n自着紫臭翁，余人赤羖䍽。\n索得屈乌爵，家风不禁益。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52322.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52322","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}